  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - The draugr unleashes an onslaught of mighty fireballs.
  - The draugr flings down hellfire from above.
  - "The draugr unleashes streams of flame.\t"
  - The draugr flings out many smaller fireballs.
  - The draugr's left hand begins crackling with electricity, while his right remains
    toasty.
  randomAttacks:
